From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:17:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] xmllite: DTD internal subset and entity expansion,
 reader/writer properties, writer names and prefixes

- reader parses the DOCTYPE internal subset (comments, PIs, ATTLIST/ELEMENT/NOTATION skipped, internal general
  entities recorded) and expands declared entities in text and attribute values, bounded by MaxEntityExpansion
- reader ConformanceLevel, RandomAccess and MaxEntityExpansion properties, GetBaseUri returns the input base URI,
  GetNamespaceUri answers for every node type
- writer MultiLanguage and ConformanceLevel properties, unknown properties give E_INVALIDARG
- writer WriteEntityRef, WriteName, WriteNmToken, WriteQualifiedName implemented
- WriteAttributeString: autogenerated pN prefixes, duplicate attribute detection, xmlns validation errors;
  the Wine todo_wine marks for these now pass and are removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

